### Test upload sur Render

@baseUrl= https://backend-cleaner-nestjs.onrender.com/api/v1

### 1. Login pour obtenir un token valide
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cleaner.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Créer un signalement avec photo (remplacer le token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer VOTRE_TOKEN_ICI

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bacId"

f8e12345-0000-4c1d-9e2f-abc123000010
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reportType"

PLEIN
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Test upload image sur Render
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="priority"

LOW
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="test-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./ProgrammerBlankPoster.jpeg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Vérifier l'image uploadée
GET https://backend-cleaner-nestjs.onrender.com/uploads/{{filename}}
